  "changes": [
    "Canonical environment/storage API origins retained; official model-specific realtime endpoints unchanged.",
    "Exact Android camera ID selection, independent capture format, observed geometry and frozen model format.",
    "Agora READ_WRITE capture observer applies installation rotation and supplies bounded local I420 gesture samples.",
    "Local Gradle consumes checksum-verified official release JNI; no NDK/publication plugins; Agora 4.6.4 replaces VolcEngine.",
    "Local camera regression tests and imported upstream 1.0.9 tests."
  ],
